00:47:32,057 --> 00:47:33,267
- kadangkala.
- Ya.

918
00:47:33,851 --> 00:47:35,060
Jangan lupa telinga.

919
00:47:35,143 --> 00:47:37,020
Tak nak benda tumbuh di situ.

920
00:47:37,104 --> 00:47:38,897
Okey.

921
00:47:38,981 --> 00:47:40,607
Apa cerita awak, Emma?

922
00:47:40,691 --> 00:47:43,569
Apa kerja ibu bapa awak?
Adik-beradik? Kekasih?

923
00:47:43,652 --> 00:47:45,445
Bunuh orang, bergaduh di bar?

924
00:47:57,416 --> 00:47:59,585
Jadi, En. Williams,

925
00:47:59,668 --> 00:48:03,839
kadang-kadang retakan tulang skafoid
tak muncul pada hari pertama.

926
00:48:03,922 --> 00:48:07,509
Nasihat saya, pakai anduh sokongan
selama dua minggu.

927
00:48:07,593 --> 00:48:11,263
Datang semula untuk X-ray ulangan
untuk pastikannya.

928
00:48:13,849 --> 00:48:15,142
Lutut saya sakit.

929
00:48:16,476 --> 00:48:18,353
Awak cedera lutut?

930
00:48:20,230 --> 00:48:21,440
Pasti begitu.

931
00:48:28,322 --> 00:48:29,489
Apa benda ini?

932
00:48:30,532 --> 00:48:33,035
Untuk tangan awak.

933
00:48:33,118 --> 00:48:34,328
Saya perlukannya?

934
00:48:36,246 --> 00:48:40,417
Kalau... John, boleh tolong? Ya.

935
00:48:41,084 --> 00:48:43,295
Jika retak dan tak memakainya,

936
00:48:43,378 --> 00:48:45,297
tulang takkan sembuh dengan baik.

937
00:48:48,842 --> 00:48:50,385
Berapa lama nak buat?

938
00:48:51,929 --> 00:48:53,555
Hanya beberapa minit.

939
00:48:56,892 --> 00:48:58,060
Tempat ini baharu?

940
00:49:02,147 --> 00:49:05,067
En. Williams, awak tahu ini hari apa?

941
00:49:09,571 --> 00:49:10,864
Selasa Taco.

942
00:49:12,449 --> 00:49:14,159
Di mana awak berada?

943
00:49:15,911 --> 00:49:18,372
Di klinik paling perlahan di West.

944
00:49:19,790 --> 00:49:21,416
Tahun berapa?

945
00:49:21,500 --> 00:49:26,338
Boleh pulihkan tangan saya
dan berhenti tanya macam-macam?

946
00:49:28,090 --> 00:49:30,092
Saya tak datang untuk jawab soalan.

947
00:49:35,097 --> 00:49:36,598
Ya, baiklah.

948
00:49:38,350 --> 00:49:39,601
Saya akan kembali.

949
00:49:51,279 --> 00:49:53,490
Baiklah, En. Digby. Dah nampak okey.

950
00:49:53,573 --> 00:49:55,450
Bau pun lebih harum.

951
00:49:55,534 --> 00:49:56,952
Ada perapi rambut?

952
00:49:57,035 --> 00:49:59,079
Mari keringkan badan dan masuk.

953
00:49:59,162 --> 00:50:01,873
Pakaikan gaun dan bawa ke Selatan 21.
Depan rahib.

954
00:50:01,957 --> 00:50:04,543
Mungkin doanya dapat membantu.

955
00:50:05,544 --> 00:50:06,545
Pesakit apa?

956
00:50:07,212 --> 00:50:09,589
Evelyn Bostick, 81 tahun, Alzheimer.

957
00:50:09,673 --> 00:50:11,758
Suaminya dihantar 30 minit lepas.

958
00:50:11,842 --> 00:50:14,761
Dia sepatutnya ikut sekali,
tapi dia merayau ke jalan.

959
00:50:14,845 --> 00:50:17,264
- Di mana kita berada?
- Di hospital.

960
00:50:17,347 --> 00:50:18,348
Saya tak sakit.

961
00:50:18,432 --> 00:50:22,436
- Kita nak jumpa suami awak.
- Aduhai. Ethan okey?

962
00:50:22,519 --> 00:50:24,479
Kami perlu cakap dengan awak.

963
00:50:25,313 --> 00:50:26,481
Suaminya dah mati.

964
00:50:27,899 --> 00:50:29,234
Kes apa, Amboy?

965
00:50:29,317 --> 00:50:32,654
Allen Billings,
palet jatuh di atas lengan.

966
00:50:32,738 --> 00:50:35,323
- Macam kehelan terbuka.
- Pasti sakit.

967
00:50:35,407 --> 00:50:36,783
Jangan risau. Kami bantu.

968
00:50:43,248 --> 00:50:44,249
Bagaimana?

969
00:50:44,332 --> 00:50:45,834
Nampak baik.

970
00:50:46,418 --> 00:50:48,086
- Ya.
- Hai.

971
00:50:48,170 --> 00:50:50,172
Baru selesai buat CBC.

972
00:50:57,637 --> 00:50:59,222
Ada masalah?

973
00:51:03,393 --> 00:51:04,811
Saya terlepas sesuatu?

974
00:51:04,895 --> 00:51:07,564
Dr. Al?

975
00:52:30,647 --> 00:52:32,649
Terjemahan oleh: NH Azizan

